there's a lot of variables

00:21:18.660 --> 00:21:19.426
in this episode.

00:21:19.426 --> 00:21:20.332
This is the variable episode

00:21:20.332 --> 00:21:21.563
where there's a lot of context points,

00:21:21.563 --> 00:21:22.979
it's not just direct answers today.

00:21:22.979 --> 00:21:25.649
Listen, you might not be passionate

00:21:25.649 --> 00:21:27.251
about your north star anymore.

00:21:27.251 --> 00:21:29.573
I've been going through something.

00:21:29.573 --> 00:21:32.034
