00:21:46.535 --> 00:21:47.946
I love--

00:21:47.946 --> 00:21:49.966
Listen, I'm still all about
buying the New York Jets

00:21:49.966 --> 00:21:52.845
and it's the process of that and the game.

00:21:52.845 --> 00:21:54.888
But it's amazing for me
to be in tune with myself.

00:21:54.888 --> 00:21:56.746
The maturity as you get older.

00:21:56.746 --> 00:21:59.416
My kids are six and three
and they're interesting.

00:21:59.416 --> 00:22:01.250
They're interesting.

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:04.640
