00:22:13.417 --> 00:22:16.087
And you might've just
lost your north star.

00:22:16.087 --> 00:22:17.759
The thing that you
thought you were going for

00:22:17.759 --> 00:22:18.734
might not be.

00:22:18.734 --> 00:22:20.938
